{"item_id":"podcast:9bb5a7b6-3598-4ba5-bbe3-b1ca9d4f6e59","version_id":"a7a078fa5d4d0db2c4eda4f6e785f1b6c5f715b4c281af9d2d46799bc4d8d1c1","decision":"accept","reason":"Under Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty, the newly reported VX4 field use in New Zealand and discussion of the newly launched MX6 provide citable material about transferable optics performance and carried weight, supporting Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Commercial incentives and Uncertainty require identifying the host's disclosed Leupold podcast partnership and the guest's Leupold engineering role: their praise and internal testing claims are not independent confirmation, and the host's reported scope failure and field successes must remain attributed. Under Exclusions, omit the ammunition advertisements and other excluded material.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
{"item_id":"podcast:d38a584f-1c87-4d80-b2e2-ad048330dd41","version_id":"f03cc2554a1abf27629dffecec4f25a37f29de3fc8d943945794873e14cc1f43","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Exclusions, and Making the decision, this is principally wind-reading training through firearm and cartridge selection, including custom trainer rifles and reloading recommendations, rather than evidence about eligible non-firearm gear. Commercial incentives also apply: Wolf Precision sells the recommended rifle systems and training, and the episode advertises MDT and Krieger.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"podcast:0f343b26-3484-4bf6-ac9b-c8b5bd263cc7","version_id":"41e500b81a40237107eeffc71af851ca9cb84cf67660f80e352cc47f30132617","decision":"reject","reason":"Although scope mounts fall under Relevance, Exclusions and Making the decision govern because the substantive content consists of scope-installation and rifle troubleshooting instructions, including lubrication, torque, and recoil-lug positioning. Credibility and Uncertainty also limit the proposed wet-mounting explanation: the single rifle had multiple unresolved problems and no controlled comparison; Commercial incentives require noting Wolf Precision's rifle and training business and its MDT and Krieger advertising.","piece_ids":[]}
